  "fixed_wrong_port": "A fixed wrong port receives no energy on this initial homogeneous stock. Starting12 cannot reach the >=31 pre-dispatch energy needed for division; no offspring regardless of its control schedule. This does not permit selecting the matching fixed control after seeing a target.",
